# Wave W15-T4 (Revelry TV tower): revtvcap-l — the west shoulder pylon of the Revelry TV tower, 16x48, bottom-anchored on the station's existing roof row (Premium+ W6 TX-3). A gold-tipped antenna needle with a crossarm steps down into a glass-band pylon in beamroof's steel-glass register; worn only at the roof run's west end (x=15). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-W15-LANDMARKS-PLAN.md §1.7/§2.)
